<title>HONG KONG: HK Elec takes Thai power project stake.</title>
<headline>HK Elec takes Thai power project stake.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hongkong Electric Holdings Ltd said on Thursday its international investment arm Hongkong Electric International Ltd has agreed to buy a 25 percent stake in Siam Steel Pipe Group's US$420 million Rayong power plant project, Siam Power Generation Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
